{"unit_id":"EagleClark__dsh-genshin-account#feature-account-overview","repo":"EagleClark/dsh-genshin-account","commit":"04dcce2c350f767b99487f25677430ff25ae842a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-account 的「账号总览」功能：汇总 UID、角色数量、元素分布、武器和圣遗物数量及最佳圣遗物。通过对话调用总览工具，返回当前账号快照的汇总。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:405-417"]}
{"unit_id":"EagleClark__dsh-genshin-account#feature-character-build","repo":"EagleClark/dsh-genshin-account","commit":"04dcce2c350f767b99487f25677430ff25ae842a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-account 的「角色练度查询」功能：按中文名、英文名或别名查单个角色，返回等级、命座、天赋、武器和已知圣遗物评分。通过角色查询工具输入角色名即可查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:446-465"]}
{"unit_id":"EagleClark__dsh-genshin-account#feature-artifact-search","repo":"EagleClark/dsh-genshin-account","commit":"04dcce2c350f767b99487f25677430ff25ae842a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-account 的「圣遗物筛选」功能：按套装、部位、装备角色和最低暴击值过滤，并按暴击值或词条效率排序。调用圣遗物工具后得到匹配装备列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:469-493"]}
{"unit_id":"EagleClark__dsh-genshin-account#feature-wish-analysis","repo":"EagleClark/dsh-genshin-account","commit":"04dcce2c350f767b99487f25677430ff25ae842a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-account 的「祈愿记录分析」功能：统计总抽数、各池抽数、五星记录和保底情况。调用祈愿工具可选择池子并限制返回的五星记录条数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:496-547"]}
{"unit_id":"EagleClark__dsh-genshin-account#feature-web-panel","repo":"EagleClark/dsh-genshin-account","commit":"04dcce2c350f767b99487f25677430ff25ae842a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-account 的「原神启动」网页面板：通过 DSH Web 客户端查看账号信息，并从设置页配置账号。插件为面板提供状态、概览、角色、圣遗物和武器数据路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:3739-3844","lib/index.js:678-735"]}
{"unit_id":"EagleClark__dsh-genshin-account#caveat-showcase-limit","repo":"EagleClark/dsh-genshin-account","commit":"04dcce2c350f767b99487f25677430ff25ae842a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-account 使用前须知：圣遗物主副词条详情来自游戏内角色展柜，只能覆盖已展示的角色；其余角色可能只有部位、名称和等级信息。（见 lib/sources/microgg.js:6-17）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/sources/microgg.js:6-17"]}
